{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mq7hef8gcd6","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/cloude","title":"[ingest] Native task IDs are session-local; cross-session refs MUST be namespaced session-uuid/id","summary":"Native task IDs ('1','2',…) are unique only within one session and sessions in a workspace don't see each other's native tasks. Any cross-session dependency edge must use {session-uuid}/{id}. This is the core reason the overlay store exists — native tasks structurally cannot hold cross-session edges.","created_by":"onboard-learn","valid_from":"2026-06-10T03:00:40.480Z","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-10T19:01:05.747Z"}
